|----------|------|-------------|
| 2.10 user wrapper `leak(token)` → `println(x)` (IMP3) | check+emit **ALLOW** | helper is a **fn**, not a macro body; `__sec_sink__` is 2.10 |
| 5.8 `${token}` | ALLOW literal | **no** expansion; IDENT never reached the sink |
| T1/T2 | not re-probed as close | named in `SECRET_TAINT.oot` |
| Alias residual-deny | check ALLOW | Z1: payload not spliced |

